  "injury_policy": "Official NBA injury report = the 5PM ET filing. Evening tips (>=18:00 ET) use the game-day 5PM report (snapshot_date == game_date); earlier tips use the day-before 5PM report (snapshot_date == game_date - 1) with 'NOT YET SUBMITTED' teams dropped. Impact = status weight (Out 1.0, Doubtful 0.5, Questionable 0.25) x player's prior-minutes share (10-game-halflife EWMA minutes over the team's last <=10 games, zeros for absences, divided by rotation minutes). injout = Out-only EWMA minutes / 240.",
  "minutes_policy": "From the cached player boxscores (chunked 50k-row reads, single pass, columns game_id/game_date/player_id/team_abbreviation/min). load7 = team minutes over prior 7 calendar days (0.0 when the window contains zero games, e.g. after the All-Star break; NaN only at cold start). top8share = mean over the team's last 5 games of top-8 minutes / team minutes. stability = mean over the last 6 games' consecutive pairs of |top5_g AND top5_prev| / 5. All histories strictly prior to the target date.",
